Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:39:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 16/25] fix(dilemma): normalize Catppuccin power, drop
 Notification Center edge, tune flick and horizontal scroll

Scale the Catppuccin colors by CATPPUCCIN_POWER_SCALE (160/255) so the effect draws about as much as a saturated one, lower the default brightness to 64 and bump the user config magic so it applies once. Remove the right edge zone, shorten the flick timeout to 100 ms and scroll horizontally one step per 1 mm.
